  "description": "Base styles, colors and icon paths for WPF apps. Includes the Nova look (default) and the original Cannoli look, each with a Light and a Dark theme. Select the look and the theme with NovaWpf.ThemeChanger.",
  "frameworkAssemblyGroup": {
    "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.11.18.07.52.10/novawpf.styles.2027.1.0-beta.1.json#frameworkassemblygroup",
