  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Nova look, with the original Cannoli look kept. CannoliControlStyles.xaml now merges CannoliClassicStyles.xaml (the original Cannoli styles) and NovaStyles.xaml (default). DarkColors.xaml and LightColors.xaml merge the original colors (ClassicDarkColors.xaml, ClassicLightColors.xaml) and the Nova colors (Nova\\NovaDarkColors.xaml, Nova\\NovaLightColors.xaml). Select the look with ThemeChanger.ApplyStyle (NovaWpf.ThemeChanger 2027.1.0). Resource keys are only added, never removed or renamed. New: NovaTokens.xaml, OnPrimary and ErrorHover colors, NovaCard, and the Nova styles of: buttons (Primary, Secondary, Text, Danger in 4 sizes, with icons), icon buttons (5 types and 3 toggle types in 4 sizes), CheckBox and RadioButton (4 sizes), TextBox and ComboBox (dropdown) (4 sizes, error state), DataGrid (3 densities), ProgressBar (linear), Separator (divider), Expander (accordion), GroupBox, switch, autocomplete.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "NovaWpf Styles",
